{"3590090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RoboSoul: Chariot", "steam_appid": 3590090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《RoboSoul: Chariot》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel-Style Co-op Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Story</strong><br>Little robots Blue and Red embark on a journey aboard their &quot;Chariot&quot; to the legendary Power Source, hoping to save their town from energy crisis. As a prequel to 《RoboSoul》, this adventure reveals the origins of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Core Gameplay</strong><br>▸ <strong>Dynamic Duo Control</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a single chariot together, seamlessly switching between 1 driver seat and 4 gunner positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seats transform into different functional modes based on each player's character (Blue/Red)<br>▸ <strong>Cooperation &amp; Chaos</strong>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based mayhem might accidentally eject your teammate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires perfect coordination for movement, attacks and energy management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Enemies &amp; Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against the mechanical &quot;Resistron Army&quot; that stands in your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your chariot's capabilities through adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Key Features</strong><br>• Classic top-down pixel art style<br>• Deep integration between character traits and chariot modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The real challenge isn't the enemies - it's not getting yeeted by your teammate!&quot;</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《RoboSoul: Chariot》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel-Style Co-op Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Story</strong><br>Little robots Blue and Red embark on a journey aboard their &quot;Chariot&quot; to the legendary Power Source, hoping to save their town from energy crisis. As a prequel to 《RoboSoul》, this adventure reveals the origins of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Core Gameplay</strong><br>▸ <strong>Dynamic Duo Control</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a single chariot together, seamlessly switching between 1 driver seat and 4 gunner positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seats transform into different functional modes based on each player's character (Blue/Red)<br>▸ <strong>Cooperation &amp; Chaos</strong>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based mayhem might accidentally eject your teammate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires perfect coordination for movement, attacks and energy management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Enemies &amp; Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against the mechanical &quot;Resistron Army&quot; that stands in your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your chariot's capabilities through adventure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Key Features</strong><br>• Classic top-down pixel art style<br>• Deep integration between character traits and chariot modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The real challenge isn't the enemies - it's not getting yeeted by your teammate!&quot;</i></p>", "short_description": "《RoboSoul: Chariot》 Retro pixel co-op adventure! Control Blue &amp; Red piloting a transforming chariot (driver + 4 gunner seats) with slick morphing animations. Battle the Resistron Army - just don't fling your teammate off!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590090